# r1115 phase 6, A1 fourth follow-up: probe tool NBT printed; vanilla /loot ... mine with a Fortune III pickaxe as the
# reference (coal ore 1 to 4, melon 3 to 9 with Fortune III).
pace 0.5

## SQ-SY-15d | Fortune reference: sy roll prints the tool NBT; /loot mine coal ore and melon with Fortune III x10 each
shell cp "$INST/tools/soil_yield_probe/sy_probe.js" kubejs/server_scripts/zz_sy_probe.js && echo copied
> reload
sleep 40
> syt roll 1020 -60 1000 300 minecraft:diamond_pickaxe@fortune=3
repeat 10
> loot spawn 1020 -50 1000 mine 1020 -60 1000 minecraft:diamond_pickaxe{Enchantments:[{id:"minecraft:fortune",lvl:3s}]}
> loot spawn 1018 -50 1000 mine 1018 -60 1000 minecraft:diamond_pickaxe{Enchantments:[{id:"minecraft:fortune",lvl:3s}]}
end
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
reject \[syt\] error
look tool nbt carries Enchantments fortune lvl 3; /loot coal counts above 1 sometimes, melon above 7 sometimes
